  "id": "vegan-indian-curry-with-cauliflower-and-lentils",
  "name": "Vegan Indian Curry with Cauliflower and Lentils",
  "subtitle": "A warming vegetable curry with tender lentils and bright herbs",
  "description": "Cauliflower, lentils, and vegetables simmer in spiced coconut milk until tender, then finish with cilantro and lemon.",
